| info = *Saryn expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''50''' [[energy]] to imbue all her weapons with potent toxins for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''20 / 25 / 35 / 45''' seconds, adding an [[Extra Hit]] for {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''20% / 24% / 26% / 30%''' of the damage of each hit as {{D|Toxin}} damage (<u>'''doubled'''</u> for [[Melee|melee weapons]]), which has a guaranteed {{D|Toxin}} proc on every strike.
**Toxic Lash adds an extra {{D|Toxin}} attack that scales with weapon damage, before health and armor resistances.
***This damage buff is applied as an [[Extra Hit]].
***For example, with an unmodded weapon whose damage sheet says it hits for 200 damage, a Rank 3 Toxic Lash, and a Rank 5 {{M|Intensify}}, Toxic Lash will deal: {{Math|200 {{mul}} 0.3 {{mul}} 1.3|mt=y}} direct {{D|Toxin}} damage, and always trigger a Toxin proc that ticks for {{Math|78 {{mul}} 0.5|mt=y}} {{D|Toxin}} damage per second to an unarmored enemy with no toxin resistance.
***If the weapon has multishot, Toxic Lash adds these Extra Hits with guaranteed Toxin procs to ''every individual multishot hit''. 
****This means that shotguns are guaranteed to stack potentially dozens of Toxin procs per shot.
***''All'' {{D|Toxin}} mods in the weapon will apply their toxin multiplier to Toxic Lash's {{D|Toxin}} status ticks, even if they are combined into other elements.
***The extra {{D|Toxin}} damage from Toxic Lash does '''not''' combine with weapon elements.
***[[Faction Damage Mods]], after first applying to the weapon's base damage, will multiply Toxic Lash's Extra Hit a second time, and then multiply its {{D|Toxin}} ticks a ''third'' time, providing multiplicative triple-dipping.
***[[Elementalist Mods]] and the increased Toxin status effect from {{Resource|Emerald Archon Shard}} stack additively to affect the damage of the {{D|Toxin}} proc.
***Status duration mods and Saryn's own passive affect the duration of the {{D|Toxin}} proc.
***Most weapon hits will trigger a Toxic Lash attack, including {{M|Acid Shells}} and {{M|Concealed Explosives}}, but not {{M|Bursting Mass}} or {{Weapon|Pathocyst}}'s maggots.
***Damage is affected by [[Ancient Disruptor]] auras and other enemies that reduce ability damage, unlike other weapon buffing skills.
***Toxic Lash's damage instance does '''not''' charge [[Incarnon]] transformations.
**Cast animation of ~'''1''' second is affected by [[Casting Speed]].
***Saryn is immune to crowd control during the cast animation.
*Casting Toxic Lash is a [[One-Handed Action|one-handed action]] that can be done while performing many actions without interrupting them, including [[reload]]ing, charging, shooting, [[Maneuvers|maneuver]]ing, and while on a [[Maneuvers#Zipline|zipline]].
**Can be recast to refresh its duration. 
| synergies =
**Toxic Lash makes {{A|Spores}} burst with every attack, even without directly hitting the spore.
**A Spore-afflicted enemy will take TWO Extra Hits from Toxic Lash, though the target will receive only one stack of Toxin status.
