| tips = *Toxic Lash's damage scales with ''all'' elemental mods (not just Toxin) and elemental buffs like {{M|Venom Dose}} and {{A|Nourish}}, even on damage instances normally unaffected by elemental mods. This includes the radial damage of slam attacks, explode on death mods such as {{M|Acid Shells}}, and mods like {{M|Concealed Explosives}}. This makes it possible for them to deal vastly more damage than normal through Toxic Lash, which is especially useful for {{Weapon|Arca Titron}}, {{Weapon|Tenet Exec}}, and {{Weapon|Sobek}}. 
**Base damage bonuses from mods (e.g. {{M|Serration}}) and abilities (e.g. {{A|Eclipse}}) do not scale Toxic Lash in this way.
